  "details": "When a player who owns an object leaves, the OnOwnershipTransferred event is not issued as the ownership reverts to the instance master. This can be worked around by checking for ownership in OnPlayerLeft, but this is a bit of an ugly hack.\nTest world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_5b333167-a735-446f-b08d-db7894c22e44\nRepro procedure:\n1. Join two clients\n2. On the non-master, click the sphere. This will take ownership.\n3. Watch the logs on the master. You'll see the ownership take event on 2.\n4. Close the non-master client.\n5. No OnOwnershipTransferred event is issued or logged. However, an OnPlayerLeft handler will log the new owner player ID.",
